msgstr "Méthode de transcription"

#: src/views/settings/cards/engine_card.py:114
msgid ""
"Only transcribes English, faster than the multilingual model of the same "
"size."
msgstr ""
"Transcrit uniquement l’anglais, plus rapide que le modèle multilingue de "
"même taille."

#: src/views/settings/cards/engine_card.py:118
msgid "Larger models are more accurate, but slower."
msgstr "Les modèles plus grands sont plus précis, mais plus lents."

#: src/views/settings/cards/engine_card.py:121
msgid "Runs on your computer. Free, private and unlimited."
msgstr "S’exécute sur votre ordinateur. Gratuit, privé et illimité."

#: src/views/settings/cards/engine_card.py:131
msgid "Runs on the servers of OpenAI. Requires an API key."
msgstr "S’exécute sur les serveurs d’OpenAI. Nécessite une clé API."

#: src/views/settings/cards/engine_card.py:135
msgid ""
"Runs on the servers of Google. An API key is optional; without it, the "
"free tier is used."
msgstr ""
"S’exécute sur les serveurs de Google. La clé API est facultative ; sans "
"elle, l’offre gratuite est utilisée."

#: src/views/settings/cards/engine_card.py:140
msgid "API key set"
msgstr "Clé API configurée"

#: src/views/settings/cards/engine_card.py:140
#: src/views/transcript/summary_panel.py:99
#: src/views/transcript/translation_panel.py:348
msgid "Set API key…"
msgstr "Configurer la clé API…"

#: src/views/settings/cards/folder_card.py:22
msgid "Watch the folder"
msgstr "Surveiller le dossier"

#: src/views/settings/cards/folder_card.py:34
msgid ""
"Keeps running and transcribes the files added to the folder, until you "
"stop it. The files it already contains are skipped."
msgstr ""
"Reste actif et transcrit les fichiers ajoutés au dossier, jusqu’à ce que "
"vous l’arrêtiez. Les fichiers déjà présents sont ignorés."

#: src/views/settings/cards/folder_card.py:39
msgid ""
"Transcribes the audio and video files of the folder and its subfolders. "
"Files that already have a transcription are skipped unless you overwrite "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Transcrit les fichiers audio et vidéo du dossier et de ses sous-dossiers."
" Les fichiers qui ont déjà une transcription sont ignorés, sauf si vous "
"les écrasez."

#: src/views/settings/cards/language_card.py:56
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Langue"

#: src/views/settings/cards/language_card.py:60
msgid "Auto-detect"
msgstr "Détection automatique"

#: src/views/settings/cards/language_card.py:63
msgid "Same as the audio"
msgstr "Identique à l’audio"

#: src/views/settings/cards/language_card.py:70
#: src/views/settings/cards/language_card.py:74
msgid "Language of the audio"
msgstr "Langue de l’audio"

#: src/views/settings/cards/language_card.py:75
#: src/views/settings/cards/language_card.py:93
#: src/views/transcript/translation_panel.py:302
msgid "Search language…"
msgstr "Rechercher une langue…"

#: src/views/settings/cards/language_card.py:76
#: src/views/settings/cards/language_card.py:94
#: src/views/transcript/translation_panel.py:303
msgid "No languages found."
msgstr "Aucune langue trouvée."

#: src/views/settings/cards/language_card.py:88
#: src/views/settings/cards/language_card.py:92
msgid "Language of the transcription"
msgstr "Langue de la transcription"

#: src/views/settings/cards/language_card.py:131
msgid "Translate with Whisper (recommended)"
msgstr "Traduire avec Whisper (recommandé)"

#: src/views/settings/cards/language_card.py:191
msgid ""
"The Google API can't translate. The transcription will be in the language"
" of the audio."
msgstr ""
"L’API Google ne peut pas traduire. La transcription sera dans la langue "
"de l’audio."

#: src/views/settings/cards/language_card.py:201
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Write it directly in {language} (experimental)"
msgstr "L’écrire directement en {language} (expérimental)"

#: src/views/settings/cards/language_card.py:219
msgid "Whisper transcribes and translates the audio in one step."
msgstr "Whisper transcrit et traduit l’audio en une seule étape."

#: src/views/settings/cards/language_card.py:223
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Whisper can only translate into {english}. For other languages, it's "
"asked to write the transcription in {language} directly. It works well "
"for many languages, but check the result."
msgstr ""
"Whisper ne peut traduire que vers : {english}. Pour les autres langues, "
"il lui est demandé d’écrire directement la transcription en {language}. "
"Cela fonctionne bien pour de nombreuses langues, mais vérifiez le "
"résultat."

#: src/views/settings/cards/live_card.py:27
msgid "Live text"
msgstr "Texte en direct"

#: src/views/settings/cards/live_card.py:30
msgid "Show the text while recording"
msgstr "Afficher le texte pendant l’enregistrement"

#: src/views/settings/cards/live_card.py:35
msgid "Live model"
msgstr "Modèle en direct"

#: src/views/settings/cards/live_card.py:62
#: src/views/settings/cards/options_card.py:116
#: src/views/settings/cards/options_card.py:145
msgid "Only available with WhisperX."
msgstr "Disponible uniquement avec WhisperX."

#: src/views/settings/cards/live_card.py:65
msgid ""
"A fast model writes a draft while you speak. When you stop, the whole "
"recording is transcribed again with the model of the engine, which is "
"more accurate."
msgstr ""
"Un modèle rapide écrit un brouillon pendant que vous parlez. Quand vous "
"vous arrêtez, tout l’enregistrement est retranscrit avec le modèle du "
"moteur, plus précis."

#: src/views/settings/cards/live_card.py:70
msgid "The text is shown when you stop recording."
msgstr "Le texte s’affiche quand vous arrêtez l’enregistrement."

#: src/views/settings/cards/options_card.py:37
msgid "Options"
msgstr "Options"

#: src/views/settings/cards/options_card.py:43
msgid "Word-level timings"
msgstr "Minutage par mot"

#: src/views/settings/cards/options_card.py:51
msgid "Extract speech"
msgstr "Extraire la voix"

#: src/views/settings/cards/options_card.py:55
msgid "Reduces music and background noise before transcribing."
msgstr "Réduit la musique et le bruit de fond avant la transcription."

#: src/views/settings/cards/options_card.py:59
msgid "Identify speakers"
msgstr "Identifier les locuteurs"

#: src/views/settings/cards/options_card.py:69
msgid "Number of speakers (0 = auto)"
msgstr "Nombre de locuteurs (0 = auto)"

#: src/views/settings/cards/options_card.py:87
msgid "Set Hugging Face token…"
msgstr "Configurer le jeton Hugging Face…"

#: src/views/settings/cards/options_card.py:119
msgid "Highlights each word while playing. The subtitles already use them."
msgstr ""
"Surligne chaque mot pendant la lecture. Les sous-titres les utilisent "
"déjà."

#: src/views/settings/cards/options_card.py:122
msgid "Highlights each word while playing. Takes a bit longer."
msgstr "Surligne chaque mot pendant la lecture. Un peu plus long."

#: src/views/settings/cards/options_card.py:132
msgid "Labels who speaks in each part. Requires a Hugging Face token."
msgstr "Indique qui parle dans chaque partie. Nécessite un jeton Hugging Face."

#: src/views/settings/cards/options_card.py:138
msgid "The model of the Whisper API identifies the speakers."
msgstr "Le modèle de l’API Whisper identifie les locuteurs."

#: src/views/settings/cards/options_card.py:141
msgid ""
"Only available with WhisperX, or with the gpt-4o-transcribe-diarize model"
" of the Whisper API."
msgstr ""
"Disponible uniquement avec WhisperX, ou avec le modèle gpt-4o-transcribe-"
"diarize de l’API Whisper."

